{"G1010":{"id":"G1010","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G1010","disambiguated_id":"G1010 =","unique_id":"G1010","headword":"βουλευτής","transliteration":"bouleutēs","lexical_morphology":"G:N-M","gloss_en":"member of a council","definition_en":"βουλευτής, -οῦ, ὁ \n (βουλεύω), [in LXX: Job.3:14 12:17 (יעץ)* ;] \na councillor, a senator; of a member of the Sanhedrin: Mrk.15:34, Luk.23:50.†\n (AS)","source_line":1132}],"occurrence_count":2,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"membro-do-conselho","count":1},{"gloss":"membro-do-conselho-de-justiça","count":1}]},"G1381":{"id":"G1381","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G1381","disambiguated_id":"G1381 =","unique_id":"G1381","headword":"δοκιμάζω","transliteration":"dokimazō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to test","definition_en":"δοκιμάζω\n (δόκιμος), [in LXX chiefly for בָּחַן ;] \n__1. primarily of metals (Pro.8:10 17:3, Sir.2:5, Wis.3:6), to test, try, prove (in the hope and expectation that the test will prove successful, see reff. s. Syn.): χρυσίον, 1Pe.1:7; other things, Luk.12:56 14:19, 2Co.8:8, Gal.6:4, 1Th.2:4 5:21; τὰ διαφέροντα, Rom.2:18, Php.1:10 (R, mg., but see infr.); πνεύματα, 1Jn.4:1; of men, 1Ti.3:10 (pass.); ἑαυτόν, 1Co.11:28, 2Co.13:5; before subst. clause, Rom.12:2, 1Co.3:13, Eph.5:10 \n __2. As the result of trial, to approve, think fit: Rom.1:28 14:22, 1Co.16:3, 2Co.8:22, 1Th.2:4 (δεδοκιμάσμεθα); τὰ διαφέροντα, Rom.2:18, Php.1:10, R, txt. (but see supr.; cf. διαφέρω).†\n (AS)","source_line":1513}],"occurrence_count":22,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"prova","count":3},{"gloss":"examine","count":2},{"gloss":"provai","count":2},{"gloss":"entender","count":1},{"gloss":"este","count":1},{"gloss":"testá","count":1},{"gloss":"reconhecer","count":1},{"gloss":"aprovas","count":1},{"gloss":"experimenteis","count":1},{"gloss":"aprova","count":1},{"gloss":"aprovardes","count":1},{"gloss":"provamos","count":1},{"gloss":"buscando","count":1},{"gloss":"aproveis","count":1},{"glo